WEBVTT

01:33.272 --> 01:35.697
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:35.808 --> 01:37.810
(Adapted from the novel "A City, Waiting for You" by Jiuyuexi)

01:38.043 --> 01:40.844
(Episode 14)

01:58.230 --> 01:59.285
Captain,

01:59.365 --> 02:00.404
there's one more floor upstairs.

02:02.334 --> 02:03.435
Let's go up!

02:03.445 --> 02:04.496
Okay.

02:10.725 --> 02:11.829
Da Peng!

02:17.045 --> 02:18.074
Calm down.

02:18.246 --> 02:19.325
Follow my lead.

02:20.246 --> 02:21.276
Yes, Yi.

02:34.926 --> 02:35.997
Are you okay?

02:38.998 --> 02:39.987
Over there!

02:40.045 --> 02:41.106
Yes, sir!

03:29.806 --> 03:31.565
Instructor, we found someone!

03:36.325 --> 03:37.413
You go first!

03:40.765 --> 03:42.000
Instructor, I'll go out now.

03:42.485 --> 03:43.926
Mind your own safety!

03:47.366 --> 03:48.366
Mr Firefighter,

03:48.846 --> 03:50.846
I had no idea that someone was still inside.

03:51.206 --> 03:52.525
This place was marked as a demolition zone long ago.

03:52.526 --> 03:53.806
No one was supposed to be inside.

03:54.806 --> 03:56.245
Even so,

03:56.246 --> 03:58.205
there might be wanderers or scavengers inside.

03:58.206 --> 04:00.045
You guys didn't do your job!

04:34.920 --> 04:36.021
Instructor,

04:36.045 --> 04:37.245
they've been inside for too long.

04:37.318 --> 04:38.685
Their oxygen tank will run out of pressure soon.

04:39.940 --> 04:40.965
Song Yan,

04:40.966 --> 04:42.244
what's the situation inside?

04:42.245 --> 04:43.446
Please reply to me if you hear this.

04:45.566 --> 04:46.684
The house is collapsing!

04:46.685 --> 04:47.724
Instructor!

04:47.725 --> 04:48.805
The house is collapsing!

04:49.326 --> 04:50.386
Song Yan!

04:50.646 --> 04:51.804
The house is collapsing!

04:51.805 --> 04:52.965
The house is collapsing!

04:52.966 --> 04:54.445
Damage has occurred!

04:54.446 --> 04:55.885
Damage has occurred!

04:55.886 --> 04:57.125
Withdraw from the operation immediately!

05:04.661 --> 05:05.687
Jiang Yi,

05:06.326 --> 05:07.485
(have you found him?)

05:09.245 --> 05:10.446
Not yet, Instructor.

05:10.685 --> 05:13.285
Remember, you must ensure his safety!

05:13.605 --> 05:15.446
Yes, Instructor! Don't worry.

05:15.966 --> 05:17.365
-Be careful. -Yes, sir.

05:38.725 --> 05:40.085
Captain!

05:40.086 --> 05:41.684
Our captain is out! Captain!

05:41.685 --> 05:43.086
Instructor, our captain is out!

06:07.285 --> 06:08.303
Captain!

06:08.925 --> 06:09.947
Come back!

06:11.125 --> 06:12.187
Captain is out!

06:12.813 --> 06:13.895
Hold your hose!

06:14.791 --> 06:15.836
Yes, sir!

06:15.925 --> 06:17.044
Jiang, the captain is out.

06:17.045 --> 06:18.326
(Withdraw immediately.)

06:19.206 --> 06:20.228
We can leave now.

06:20.365 --> 06:21.485
Da Peng, tell the instructor.

06:21.654 --> 06:22.660
Yes, sir.

06:22.685 --> 06:24.206
Put out the fire. Let's withdraw.

06:24.446 --> 06:25.462
Yes, sir.

06:50.277 --> 06:51.267
How is it?

06:51.446 --> 06:52.490
What's the situation?

07:07.685 --> 07:08.780
How long has she been unconscious?

07:08.805 --> 07:10.206
She was unconscious when I found her.

07:10.446 --> 07:11.646
Did you take any emergency measures?

07:11.805 --> 07:13.526
She was hurt. I only provided her with some oxygen.

07:13.646 --> 07:15.326
-Have you contacted her family? -She has no family members.

07:23.766 --> 07:25.364
Dr Xu, the old woman who was sent here

07:25.365 --> 07:26.446
was pronounced dead.

07:29.605 --> 07:30.605
Try your best to save her.

07:49.766 --> 07:51.326
Investigate the area thoroughly for sparks.

07:51.483 --> 07:52.499
Okay.

07:53.846 --> 07:54.906
Good job, guys.

07:56.566 --> 07:57.662
Instructor,

07:58.886 --> 08:00.725
I saved your baby for you.

08:02.373 --> 08:04.485
This sucks.

08:05.446 --> 08:06.498
Don't blame it on the item.

08:06.925 --> 08:07.966
It's because I sucked.

08:08.646 --> 08:09.805
I can rest at ease then.

08:11.526 --> 08:12.645
Do a proper job!

08:12.646 --> 08:13.966
Okay.

08:26.084 --> 08:27.115
Da Peng,

08:27.586 --> 08:28.633
how was it?

08:28.685 --> 08:29.685
It was your first time joining a fire rescue mission.

08:30.006 --> 08:31.080
How do you feel?

08:33.125 --> 08:34.405
The real deal is different indeed.

08:36.046 --> 08:37.125
I have to train harder.

08:39.686 --> 08:40.876
What's on your mind?

08:42.727 --> 08:43.736
Squad Leader,

08:43.966 --> 08:44.966
you're so strong.

08:45.704 --> 08:47.344
You picked me up like I was a chick.

08:47.653 --> 08:48.734
Did you remember that then?

08:49.966 --> 08:50.989
I did.

08:54.926 --> 08:56.925
I want to take a hot water bath right now.

08:56.926 --> 08:58.365
Forget about the hot water bath.

08:59.365 --> 09:00.485
Just give me somewhere to lie down.

09:00.765 --> 09:02.286
Let me sleep for three days and nights.

09:02.686 --> 09:03.846
Just you wish.

09:04.005 --> 09:05.013
When we head back,

09:05.166 --> 09:06.166
we still have physical training to do.

09:08.429 --> 09:09.444
We'll do it.

09:09.525 --> 09:10.686
We'll do our best in the training.

09:36.885 --> 09:38.166
How is the victim?

09:38.605 --> 09:39.660
They're in the middle of rescuing her.

09:40.325 --> 09:41.427
But the old woman...

10:01.197 --> 10:02.223
You're right.

10:03.365 --> 10:04.405
Experience is vital when it comes

10:05.125 --> 10:06.365
to the frontline of a fire rescue mission.

10:07.125 --> 10:08.286
As an instructor, I

10:09.525 --> 10:10.525
should gain more experience.

10:17.846 --> 10:19.365
Our instructor is striving to improve himself.

10:19.846 --> 10:20.871
I have no qualms with that.

10:21.723 --> 10:24.046
What do you hope for the most after every mission?

10:33.485 --> 10:34.638
For our roster to stay complete.

10:37.765 --> 10:40.113
You brats did well today.

10:41.086 --> 10:42.686
-Are you guys exhausted? -No.

10:43.446 --> 10:45.086
-You guys must be hungry. -Yeah.

10:45.854 --> 10:46.941
Let's go to a restaurant

10:46.966 --> 10:48.009
and have our fill.

10:48.405 --> 10:49.645
Nice!

10:51.046 --> 10:52.566
Has the quartermaster prepared everything?

10:53.086 --> 10:54.405
The quartermaster and I have made some arrangements.

10:55.245 --> 10:56.289
Let's go.

10:58.725 --> 10:59.746
Instructor, join us.

11:01.846 --> 11:02.891
I...

11:03.446 --> 11:04.566
Let me train first.

11:05.405 --> 11:07.085
Just forget about it. Your tool is all burnt up.

11:07.086 --> 11:08.446
Get yourself another drone if you have the dough.

11:21.326 --> 11:22.565
We suspect

11:22.566 --> 11:24.206
she's suffering from closed abdominal visceral injury.

11:24.566 --> 11:25.805
She should be transferred to the Department of General Surgery

11:25.806 --> 11:27.086
for a laparotomy.

11:27.885 --> 11:29.325
Laparotomy causes huge trauma to both physical

11:29.326 --> 11:30.686
and mental state of the body.

11:30.966 --> 11:32.524
I suggest a conservative treatment.

11:32.525 --> 11:33.566
Let's replenish her fluids and observe her condition.

11:34.446 --> 11:35.565
This child was already unconscious

11:35.566 --> 11:36.686
when she was sent here.

11:36.806 --> 11:38.765
The ultrasound scan shows that she's experiencing abdominal effusion.

11:39.125 --> 11:41.286
Conservative treatment might lead to further complications.

11:42.326 --> 11:43.845
We performed a paracentasis on her just now.

11:43.846 --> 11:45.046
There was no blood coagulation.

11:45.150 --> 11:46.991
The ultrasound scan also shows that it was a mild abdominal effusion.

11:47.286 --> 11:48.325
Her splenic capsule is complete.

11:48.326 --> 11:49.525
That means her spleen is functioning normally.

11:50.615 --> 11:51.965
However, according to the ultrasound scan,

11:51.966 --> 11:53.286
there's a haematoma under her Glisson's capsule.

11:53.566 --> 11:54.566
It's a sign of a ruptured liver.

11:54.966 --> 11:57.245
However, she's experiencing toxic encephalopathy

11:57.405 --> 11:58.926
due to inhaling excess toxic gas.

11:59.245 --> 12:01.005
The haematoma under her Glisson's capsule isn't the main issue here.

12:01.446 --> 12:02.605
You're taking a risk here.

12:03.046 --> 12:04.235
Under such circumstances,

12:04.566 --> 12:06.286
I think performing a laparotomy is the safest action.

12:07.166 --> 12:08.966
Performing a laparotomy is indeed the safest action.

12:09.365 --> 12:11.846
However, the haematoma under her Glisson's capsule is stable.

12:11.926 --> 12:14.005
It's highly that it might be absorbed after a conservative treatment.

12:14.846 --> 12:16.086
The fire yesterday

12:16.206 --> 12:17.286
was on the news.

12:17.504 --> 12:18.524
Firefighters risked their lives

12:18.525 --> 12:20.725
to save this child.

12:21.365 --> 12:22.365
If something happens to her

12:22.366 --> 12:23.405
while she's in our hospital,

12:23.605 --> 12:25.446
can you bear the responsibility?

12:26.525 --> 12:27.527
Thank you for the reminder.

12:27.566 --> 12:28.725
I'm her attending physician.

12:28.761 --> 12:29.796
I will be responsible for her.

12:29.894 --> 12:30.941
Alright then.

12:30.966 --> 12:32.604
Call me anytime if you need anything.

12:34.926 --> 12:36.069
Okay. Good job.

12:38.537 --> 12:40.497
Dr Xu, are you sure about this?

12:40.885 --> 12:42.671
Didn't you confirm the validity of my statement too?

12:43.846 --> 12:45.484
Your career will be ruined

12:45.485 --> 12:46.846
if the reporters report about this.

12:47.926 --> 12:49.125
As a doctor,

12:49.286 --> 12:51.484
my diagnosis has nothing to do with the reporters.

12:51.485 --> 12:53.046
Are they the doctor here? Or am I the doctor here?

12:56.086 --> 12:57.566
Sometimes, I'm pretty envious of you.

12:58.166 --> 12:59.491
A person like you with a strong family background

12:59.645 --> 13:01.245
has more grounds for you to hold your stand.

13:01.994 --> 13:03.054
Sorry about that.

13:03.245 --> 13:05.286
I'm holding my stand due to my professionalism.

13:06.230 --> 13:07.331
Provide her with the highest level of care.

13:10.765 --> 13:11.852
Okay, doctor.

13:24.885 --> 13:26.686
Here are your fried chickens.

13:26.806 --> 13:28.125
-Eat up. -Mister.

13:28.446 --> 13:29.605
You can distribute them to those brats first.

13:30.525 --> 13:31.965
Okay. Distribute them yourselves.

13:31.966 --> 13:32.966
-Thank you. -Thank you, mister.

13:32.967 --> 13:34.244
-Thank you, mister. -Come.

13:34.245 --> 13:35.250
I'll be back soon.

13:36.645 --> 13:37.744
Tear it for me.

13:38.125 --> 13:39.286
Look at them.

13:41.166 --> 13:42.301
He fell asleep.

13:42.525 --> 13:43.685
Here you go.

13:43.686 --> 13:45.045
-Have them while they're hot. -Thank you, mister.

13:45.046 --> 13:46.326
-Good job, kids. -Thank you.

13:46.750 --> 13:47.850
Thank you, mister.

13:47.997 --> 13:48.985
Don't mention it.

13:49.566 --> 13:51.765
-This is delicious. -Just use your hands.

13:52.046 --> 13:53.764
-Won't you mind it? -Mind what?

13:53.765 --> 13:54.833
I'll use my hands then.

13:56.286 --> 13:57.806
Mister, we made an order just now.

13:58.485 --> 13:59.562
Your order is ready.

13:59.785 --> 14:00.782
Thank you.

14:00.885 --> 14:02.086
Don't mention it. See you next time.

14:04.605 --> 14:05.685
What's with all the firefighters?

14:05.686 --> 14:06.697
I don't know.

14:12.286 --> 14:13.965
I have a report to make! Da Peng was checking the hot girls out.

14:19.046 --> 14:20.245
You already checked them out.

14:20.885 --> 14:21.935
Just admit it.

14:22.605 --> 14:24.005
Who said I didn't want to admit it?

14:24.125 --> 14:26.166
I just want to get into a relationship.

14:26.566 --> 14:28.404
Captain and Chi are still here, you know?

14:28.405 --> 14:29.765
Aren't you embarrassed?

14:30.765 --> 14:31.899
I heard nothing.

14:32.365 --> 14:33.884
-I heard nothing too. -Me too.

14:33.885 --> 14:34.973
If so, I want to get into a relationship too.

14:35.485 --> 14:37.276
With what?

14:38.122 --> 14:39.958
You don't have a car, house, or time.

14:40.245 --> 14:41.645
And, you're ugly. No one wants to be your girlfriend.

14:43.086 --> 14:44.725
I don't agree with the last point.

14:49.125 --> 14:50.283
Thank you.

15:13.005 --> 15:14.205
The hospital's administration office called us.

15:14.206 --> 15:15.524
They said reporters were outside the hospital.

15:15.525 --> 15:16.724
The media wanted to interview us.

15:16.725 --> 15:18.166
They told us to tell them nothing.

15:19.238 --> 15:20.251
Dr Xu,

15:20.326 --> 15:21.605
why don't you take a break?

15:21.686 --> 15:23.846
You didn't sleep a wink since last night.

15:24.286 --> 15:26.046
Got it. I'll be done in a second.

15:27.286 --> 15:29.085
Dr Xu is back. Our superiors told him to come

15:29.086 --> 15:30.524
right after he got off the plane.

15:30.525 --> 15:31.675
He wants us to see him.

15:33.086 --> 15:34.114
Let's go.

15:39.605 --> 15:41.364
The victim was injured by heavy objects.

15:41.365 --> 15:42.524
Through the ultrasound scan, we found

15:42.525 --> 15:44.485
a haematoma under her Glisson's capsule.

15:44.846 --> 15:46.525
We established intravenous access

15:47.125 --> 15:48.605
and provided her with anti-inflammation fluids

15:48.765 --> 15:50.365
to maintain water and electrolyte balance

15:50.605 --> 15:51.744
to rectify her state of shock.

15:59.446 --> 16:01.166
Were you the one who decided not to operate on her?

16:01.607 --> 16:02.653
Yes, sir.

16:03.005 --> 16:05.525
I think there are no obvious symptoms that require surgery.

16:05.846 --> 16:07.124
Conservative treatment can reduce

16:07.125 --> 16:08.244
unnecessary surgical trauma

16:08.245 --> 16:09.326
and anaesthesia complications.

16:14.166 --> 16:15.166
You made

16:16.166 --> 16:17.255
the correct decision.

16:18.669 --> 16:19.844
Don't worry.

16:20.166 --> 16:21.405
She'll regain consciousness soon.

16:28.885 --> 16:30.445
Keep an eye on her condition. You can transfer her to the

16:30.446 --> 16:31.805
observation ward once she regains consciousness.

16:31.806 --> 16:32.885
Okay.

16:47.719 --> 16:49.358
(The child is safe.)

17:01.300 --> 17:02.357
Hello, Captain.

17:07.846 --> 17:09.034
Captain.

17:10.174 --> 17:11.342
(The child is safe.)

17:14.670 --> 17:15.737
What are you doing?

17:16.165 --> 17:17.925
Have you encountered something pleasant lately?

17:18.165 --> 17:19.225
No.

17:20.143 --> 17:21.526
Something feels off about you.

17:22.246 --> 17:23.486
Speak for yourself.

17:24.046 --> 17:26.046
-Mind your own business. -I'm your instructor.

17:26.326 --> 17:27.684
Your emotional state and

17:27.685 --> 17:29.245
changes are my business.

17:29.246 --> 17:30.326
I have to be responsible for them.

17:30.486 --> 17:31.532
If you're too free,

17:31.965 --> 17:33.073
you can chat with Meng.

17:34.965 --> 17:36.012
Let's drop that topic.

17:36.405 --> 17:37.450
Let's talk about something else.

17:42.846 --> 17:44.005
You were part of the Special Forces

17:44.006 --> 17:45.111
when you were in the border defence forces.

17:45.605 --> 17:46.965
Why did you come to the fire station?

17:48.046 --> 17:49.165
I couldn't stand it anymore.

17:49.645 --> 17:51.046
Not everyone is like you, you know?

17:51.165 --> 17:52.301
Your father has a strong background.

17:52.326 --> 17:53.405
You can do whatever you want.

17:56.766 --> 17:58.086
You're good at everything

17:58.445 --> 17:59.486
except for lying.

18:00.925 --> 18:02.205
I read your profile before.

18:02.528 --> 18:04.489
You rendered second-class merit when you were in the border defence forces.

18:05.526 --> 18:07.364
You rendered second-class merit as a member of a frontline unit

18:07.365 --> 18:08.526
in a peaceful era like ours.

18:09.405 --> 18:10.925
That means you must've risked your life.

18:25.165 --> 18:26.249
The doctor said

18:26.526 --> 18:27.645
the child is safe.

18:28.165 --> 18:29.172
I know that.

18:32.685 --> 18:33.726
Did you know this?

18:35.726 --> 18:38.006
Her mother ran off with a rich man.

18:38.383 --> 18:39.494
Her father abandoned her.

18:40.645 --> 18:42.165
How could parents like them even exist?

18:48.205 --> 18:49.365
-Zi Hao. -Go away.

18:49.445 --> 18:50.685
Slow down.

18:51.046 --> 18:52.166
Wait for me.

18:53.646 --> 18:55.684
-Don't do that. -Go away.

18:55.685 --> 18:57.045
Your face is full of sweat.

18:57.046 --> 18:58.565
Don't do that. Go away.

18:58.566 --> 18:59.964
Mind your own business.

18:59.965 --> 19:01.845
Let's have some fruits, okay?

19:01.846 --> 19:03.010
Give it a try.

19:03.605 --> 19:06.046
Go away. Mind your own business.

20:18.286 --> 20:19.392
What's the matter?

20:19.806 --> 20:20.964
You were the one

20:20.965 --> 20:23.405
who brought me off the boat.

20:25.270 --> 20:26.408
What are you saying?

20:26.925 --> 20:28.325
There was a boat.

20:28.326 --> 20:29.964
On the boat

20:29.965 --> 20:31.526
were people I didn't know.

20:31.965 --> 20:33.566
They were in black.

20:34.125 --> 20:35.806
My grandmother was there too.

20:36.326 --> 20:38.404
I wanted to cling to my grandmother.

20:38.405 --> 20:40.925
But she kept pushing me away.

20:41.125 --> 20:44.046
She told me to leave with the lady in white.

20:44.365 --> 20:45.452
It was you.

20:45.685 --> 20:47.806
When the boat was departing,

20:47.925 --> 20:49.365
you were the one

20:49.486 --> 20:50.965
who brought me off the boat.

21:06.286 --> 21:07.965
Dr Xu prescribed two more medications to her.

21:09.286 --> 21:10.685
The netizens dug out her background.

21:10.965 --> 21:12.526
This child is called Little Tangerine.

21:13.006 --> 21:14.485
She was abandoned by her parents since young.

21:14.486 --> 21:15.884
She was living together

21:15.885 --> 21:17.486
with her grandmother, which wasn't related to her by blood.

21:17.965 --> 21:19.286
During this fire,

21:19.892 --> 21:21.853
the old madam sacrificed herself to save this child.

21:22.246 --> 21:24.165
The media is searching for her parents.

21:24.405 --> 21:25.726
However, they couldn't find them.

21:26.486 --> 21:27.924
They abandoned their child on purpose.

21:27.925 --> 21:29.726
How could they appear again?

21:30.405 --> 21:31.430
Yeah.

21:31.605 --> 21:32.846
Poor child.

21:33.605 --> 21:35.845
She's so young. What should she do in the future?

21:35.846 --> 21:37.765
Enough. Stop being sentimental.

21:37.766 --> 21:39.526
Prescribe the medicine and give her the drip.

21:51.205 --> 21:52.565
Dr Xu, sorry to interrupt you.

21:52.566 --> 21:54.485
The public is very concerned about Little Tangerine's condition.

21:54.486 --> 21:55.644
Everyone is worried about her.

21:55.645 --> 21:56.806
May we know about her condition?

21:57.486 --> 21:58.765
Little Tangerine has regained consciousness.

21:58.766 --> 22:00.164
She needs to rest and recuperate for two weeks.

22:00.165 --> 22:01.205
Thank you for the concern.

22:01.605 --> 22:03.444
The public has been trying to help her search for her parents.

22:03.445 --> 22:05.045
Dr Xu, as her saviour,

22:05.046 --> 22:06.565
do you have anything you want to tell

22:06.566 --> 22:07.845
her family members?

22:07.846 --> 22:08.884
Can you call her mother

22:08.885 --> 22:10.246
to visit her as soon as possible?

22:10.600 --> 22:11.575
Her mother?

22:11.605 --> 22:13.684
Yes. This is one of the hottest topics nowadays.

22:13.685 --> 22:14.765
People are donating money and items to her.

22:14.766 --> 22:16.514
They're also searching for her mother.

22:18.384 --> 22:20.384
Her mother abandoned her child in the first place.

22:20.566 --> 22:21.965
Why are you guys searching for her?

22:22.645 --> 22:24.689
A person like her doesn't deserve to be a mother.

22:25.165 --> 22:26.457
Little Tangerine

22:26.806 --> 22:28.925
might lead a better life without her.

22:53.326 --> 22:54.391
Thank you.

22:54.766 --> 22:55.939
What are you doing here?

22:57.445 --> 22:58.605
The girl was holding this in her arms

22:58.806 --> 23:00.006
when I found her.

23:00.125 --> 23:01.445
Yang Chi washed it for her.

23:03.362 --> 23:04.885
I'll send it to the ward.

23:07.399 --> 23:08.573
According to the news,

23:08.685 --> 23:10.566
you were the one who decided not to perform surgery on her.

23:13.605 --> 23:15.166
Weren't you afraid that the child might not wake up?

23:17.365 --> 23:18.676
Were you afraid that you might die in a fire

23:18.806 --> 23:20.006
when you attempt a fire rescue mission?

23:24.205 --> 23:25.264
You want me to be honest?

23:25.566 --> 23:26.615
Of course.

23:27.605 --> 23:28.605
I didn't think of it that much.

23:29.165 --> 23:30.302
I just did my best.

23:31.685 --> 23:32.891
But actually,

23:34.006 --> 23:35.326
I do feel fear after that.

23:37.326 --> 23:38.469
Me too.

23:43.046 --> 23:44.566
Dr Xu, you can do it.

23:48.645 --> 23:49.685
You've become gentler,

23:49.846 --> 23:50.949
Captain Song.

23:52.726 --> 23:54.165
It's because you didn't realise it in the past.

24:07.165 --> 24:08.310
Little Tangerine,

24:11.006 --> 24:12.486
look at what I've brought.

24:21.365 --> 24:22.420
Are you happy?

24:22.806 --> 24:23.914
You must be happy, right?

24:24.645 --> 24:25.925
Look, its tail fell off.

24:26.566 --> 24:27.647
The tail.

24:51.405 --> 24:52.499
Be careful.

24:52.885 --> 24:54.006
I can walk by myself.

24:54.086 --> 24:55.306
-Go away. -Mind the steps.

25:21.326 --> 25:22.526
She doesn't resemble my mother.

25:23.846 --> 25:24.883
This isn't her.

25:26.205 --> 25:27.266
It's not her.

25:36.165 --> 25:37.205
Don't be sad.

25:39.165 --> 25:40.286
Why should I be sad?

25:51.326 --> 25:52.388
Look.

25:52.885 --> 25:54.086
I have plenty of money.

25:55.405 --> 25:56.846
Why did you bring so much cash with you?

25:57.046 --> 25:58.132
Do you want some?

25:58.365 --> 25:59.420
No.

26:03.086 --> 26:05.566
My mum said we could buy happiness with money.

26:06.365 --> 26:07.725
You look unhappy right now.

26:07.726 --> 26:08.965
I want to buy some happiness for you.

26:09.685 --> 26:10.965
My mother said the same thing too.

26:14.766 --> 26:15.885
It's plain nonsense.

26:17.086 --> 26:18.486
How is this nonsense?

26:19.885 --> 26:20.910
It's fine

26:21.405 --> 26:22.452
as long as you have enough to spend.

26:23.566 --> 26:25.165
Having too little or too much money

26:25.645 --> 26:27.006
will cause tragedies.

26:28.965 --> 26:29.965
It will cause people to be unhappy.

26:35.165 --> 26:36.292
I don't understand.

26:47.685 --> 26:48.766
She's pretty happy.

26:53.246 --> 26:54.365
Have you contacted her family members?

26:54.605 --> 26:56.125
She was an abandoned child.

26:56.486 --> 26:57.846
Her parents were no longer reachable.

27:00.445 --> 27:01.486
With parents like them,

27:02.685 --> 27:03.766
it's not necessarily a bad thing

27:04.165 --> 27:05.566
to stay away from them.

27:07.486 --> 27:09.046
Welfare organizations are pretty complete nowadays.

27:09.365 --> 27:10.685
We cannot decide where we will be born.

27:11.165 --> 27:12.165
However, we can decide our own lives.

27:15.918 --> 27:16.945
So,

27:17.365 --> 27:18.645
are you free this Saturday?

27:20.415 --> 27:21.435
Yeah.

27:27.685 --> 27:28.925
Sorry, I have to answer a call.

27:31.326 --> 27:32.311
Hello, Mum?

27:32.685 --> 27:33.813
Qin Qin,

27:34.846 --> 27:35.925
Jiang Yu's mother wants to see you

27:36.125 --> 27:37.605
this Saturday.

27:39.046 --> 27:40.845
(Mum, I told you already.)

27:40.846 --> 27:42.086
He and I aren't meant for each other.

27:42.885 --> 27:44.039
(I already made an appointment with her.)

27:44.445 --> 27:45.526
It's fine even if you're busy.

27:45.982 --> 27:46.986
I'll bring them to the hospital

27:47.165 --> 27:48.965
to visit you then.

27:52.418 --> 27:53.560
No need for that.

27:54.219 --> 27:55.380
I will be there.

28:09.086 --> 28:10.086
Sorry.

28:10.846 --> 28:11.885
This Saturday, I...

28:12.486 --> 28:13.538
That's fine.

28:27.086 --> 28:29.125
Qin Qin, you're so refined and elegant.

28:30.165 --> 28:31.205
Thank you, Madam.

28:32.645 --> 28:35.045
By the way, I heard that you're a doctor.

28:35.046 --> 28:37.526
Are you busy with work usually?

28:38.645 --> 28:39.685
That's right.

28:40.165 --> 28:41.165
I don't want her

28:41.166 --> 28:42.405
to work as a doctor.

28:43.326 --> 28:44.445
I want her to find

28:44.806 --> 28:46.404
a simple and relaxing job.

28:46.405 --> 28:47.437
Isn't that better?

28:48.125 --> 28:49.725
Children nowadays

28:49.726 --> 28:51.005
have their own opinions.

28:51.006 --> 28:52.486
They won't listen to us.

28:52.645 --> 28:53.964
My son is the same.

28:53.965 --> 28:55.486
He's busy all day long.

28:55.766 --> 28:57.125
It's hard for me

28:57.286 --> 28:58.445
to see him around.

28:58.605 --> 29:00.605
They can make time for us if they wish to see us.

29:01.006 --> 29:02.006
Thank you.

29:02.262 --> 29:03.321
Look.

29:03.445 --> 29:04.607
My daughter

29:04.726 --> 29:05.885
is already here, right?

29:06.254 --> 29:07.310
Yeah.

29:07.486 --> 29:08.805
You two are super busy.

29:08.806 --> 29:09.925
Now that you two have time to see each other,

29:10.405 --> 29:11.846
I assume it must be fate that brought you two together.

29:17.205 --> 29:18.305
Mister,

29:18.566 --> 29:19.806
I just joined the fire station not long ago.

29:20.246 --> 29:21.246
I barely have any concepts

29:21.445 --> 29:22.645
about the fire station.

29:23.286 --> 29:24.326
Sorry for the embarrassment.

29:24.645 --> 29:25.965
You can only climb upward if you're willing to start from the bottom.

29:26.246 --> 29:27.965
If you're willing to train yourself at the bottom,

29:28.365 --> 29:29.925
you'll have a bright future ahead.

29:30.006 --> 29:31.846
Thank you. You flatter me.

29:32.885 --> 29:33.957
You see,

29:34.526 --> 29:35.605
I don't have any lofty aspirations.

29:36.405 --> 29:37.565
I'm satisfied

29:37.566 --> 29:38.566
if I can achieve something

29:39.526 --> 29:40.644
in my position.

29:40.645 --> 29:42.165
Youngsters nowadays

29:42.726 --> 29:44.046
are very ambitious.

29:44.605 --> 29:45.965
It's rare to find someone

29:46.365 --> 29:47.486
as down-to-earth as you.

29:47.885 --> 29:48.885
You flatter me.

29:50.069 --> 29:51.157
Have some tea.

29:59.526 --> 30:01.006
You performed well just now.

30:04.286 --> 30:05.806
I rushed here

30:06.486 --> 30:07.806
without any preparations.

30:08.885 --> 30:10.486
We just talked about my work.

30:12.046 --> 30:13.125
My father will think

30:13.286 --> 30:14.445
that you have a modest family tradition.

30:14.645 --> 30:15.685
He'll think that you're ambitious

30:16.086 --> 30:17.145
and not concerned about trivial details.

30:17.605 --> 30:19.046
You should stop complimenting me.

30:19.726 --> 30:21.005
I have no achievements at all.

30:21.006 --> 30:22.046
It's a far cry from my true self.

30:22.405 --> 30:23.645
In my father's eyes,

30:23.846 --> 30:24.925
you're honest, hard-working,

30:25.086 --> 30:26.165
modest, and prudent.

30:29.165 --> 30:30.205
Do you like me?

30:32.165 --> 30:33.445
I think you're a nice lady.

30:33.685 --> 30:35.205
But I don't think I like you.

30:35.685 --> 30:37.046
Because we made our acquaintances

30:37.685 --> 30:38.685
too hastily.

30:40.685 --> 30:41.742
And,

30:43.846 --> 30:44.879
I already have someone I fancy.

30:48.885 --> 30:50.125
So, your parents object to it?

30:57.165 --> 30:58.286
What do you wish to do then?

30:58.645 --> 30:59.685
Do you need my help?

31:05.263 --> 31:06.566
So, your husband...

31:07.965 --> 31:09.364
He works for the government.

31:09.365 --> 31:10.423
It's difficult for him to take some time off.

31:10.566 --> 31:12.285
He told me to send his regards.

31:12.286 --> 31:13.372
Sorry about that.

31:14.605 --> 31:15.805
Since fate has brought us together,

31:15.806 --> 31:17.006
we should meet up more often in the future.

31:17.486 --> 31:18.884
We should meet up more often.

31:18.885 --> 31:20.526
-Yeah. -Our children

31:20.726 --> 31:21.925
should meet up more often too.

31:22.086 --> 31:23.846
The nature of my work is pretty unique.

31:24.526 --> 31:25.645
It's hard for me to take some time off too.

31:25.885 --> 31:26.996
I don't think I can

31:27.326 --> 31:28.326
meet up with her that often.

31:29.726 --> 31:31.485
My son is pretty frank.

31:31.486 --> 31:32.526
You have holidays, right?

31:32.645 --> 31:34.645
You guys can see each other during the holidays.

31:35.205 --> 31:36.684
Mum, I feel like sleeping during holidays.

31:36.685 --> 31:37.964
Meeting you is tough enough.

31:37.965 --> 31:38.965
You expect me to meet someone else?

31:41.086 --> 31:42.285
That's good.

31:42.286 --> 31:43.286
Youngsters

31:43.486 --> 31:44.965
should hone their skills more often

31:45.205 --> 31:47.645
so that they can achieve something great in the future.

31:48.165 --> 31:49.566
But I don't have any lofty aspirations.

31:50.165 --> 31:51.365
I like working

31:51.488 --> 31:52.558
at the bottom level.

31:52.766 --> 31:55.685
I'm satisfied as long as I can do my part.

32:00.685 --> 32:03.165
-We... -Why don't we dig in?

32:04.486 --> 32:05.566
Jiang, you're driving today.

32:05.685 --> 32:06.726
Don't take alcohol.

32:07.645 --> 32:08.885
-Please. -Thank you.

32:09.125 --> 32:10.295
Here.

32:18.846 --> 32:19.877
Please.

32:20.125 --> 32:21.204
Okay.

32:27.365 --> 32:28.365
What a shame.

32:29.766 --> 32:31.685
You and Jiang are old friends.

32:32.086 --> 32:33.684
If our children do date each other,

32:33.685 --> 32:36.326
it'll be beneficial to the company too.

32:36.526 --> 32:38.965
They do look good together.

32:40.766 --> 32:43.365
Jiang's son is pretty good indeed.

32:43.925 --> 32:45.119
He's down-to-earth.

32:45.766 --> 32:48.086
However, I think there's no spark

32:49.365 --> 32:50.726
between him and Qin Qin.

32:51.046 --> 32:52.086
He won't do.

32:52.341 --> 32:53.444
He has no dreams

32:53.685 --> 32:54.885
or a sense of responsibility.

32:55.205 --> 32:57.086
He's unlike our children.

32:57.326 --> 32:58.885
Our children are down-to-earth and obedient.

33:42.205 --> 33:43.405
What's wrong with you today?

33:43.846 --> 33:44.925
You were so impolite.

33:46.605 --> 33:48.326
I was stating facts.

33:50.286 --> 33:51.566
Don't you like Xu Qin?

33:51.965 --> 33:53.031
She's a nice person.

33:53.405 --> 33:54.645
But her mother doesn't take a liking to me.

33:55.365 --> 33:56.885
She takes a liking to you and my father.

33:57.846 --> 33:59.566
Her mother hopes that you can develop

33:59.605 --> 34:00.925
your career better.

34:01.125 --> 34:02.164
What kind of development?

34:02.165 --> 34:03.486
Is there something wrong with my career?

34:04.405 --> 34:05.485
I thought it was a blind date.

34:05.486 --> 34:07.246
What's with the career assessment?

34:07.726 --> 34:09.405
Seems like you're truly angry about this.

34:10.005 --> 34:11.885
It's rare to see you like this.

34:12.126 --> 34:13.395
I'm not angry.

34:14.126 --> 34:15.806
The person who will be with me in the future

34:16.246 --> 34:18.005
must first be able to accept my career choice.

35:11.354 --> 35:13.423
"Qin Qin, I'm sorry"

35:20.021 --> 35:21.085
You and your brother

35:21.326 --> 35:22.646
always make me worried.

35:22.766 --> 35:24.565
Was he possessed during his birthday?

35:25.005 --> 35:26.925
Did you know something? He had a drink here

35:27.646 --> 35:28.885
and got into a fight.

35:30.925 --> 35:32.843
I never knew that he was someone like that.

35:36.445 --> 35:37.981
Don't tell me you argued with him again?

35:38.965 --> 35:40.050
Was it because of Song Yan again?

35:42.806 --> 35:44.925
What's with you and Song Yan now?

35:45.326 --> 35:46.565
Are you two dating each other again?

35:47.246 --> 35:48.281
No.

35:50.095 --> 35:51.862
You're as indecisive as ever, huh?

35:52.525 --> 35:54.885
Can't you be decisive for once?

35:55.200 --> 35:57.919
We have plenty of chances to take and decisions to make in life.

35:58.965 --> 36:00.166
Isn't it better to lead

36:00.365 --> 36:01.397
a carefree and joyful life?

36:02.485 --> 36:04.005
Can you stop bringing that up?

36:04.166 --> 36:05.885
Just when I've calmed myself down.

36:07.286 --> 36:08.278
Qin,

36:08.485 --> 36:10.445
since you're not satisfied with this result,

36:10.525 --> 36:11.525
you should give it a try.

36:12.654 --> 36:13.687
Once you've done that,

36:13.925 --> 36:15.606
even if you have to go through something unpleasant,

36:16.055 --> 36:17.974
you'll feel much better when you come back

36:18.846 --> 36:20.445
and follow your mother's arrangements.

36:21.246 --> 36:23.485
It's just a relationship.

36:23.620 --> 36:24.659
Relax.

36:24.846 --> 36:27.063
You're giving yourself too much pressure.

36:29.846 --> 36:31.868
He's not someone who will get into a relationship on a whim.

36:33.925 --> 36:35.085
Wait, he's not willing to date you?

36:35.341 --> 36:36.386
That can't be.

36:37.405 --> 36:38.606
I'm not willing to date him too.

36:39.429 --> 36:41.150
I can date anyone if I just want

36:41.230 --> 36:42.249
to get into a casual relationship.

36:42.365 --> 36:43.410
But not him.

36:43.813 --> 36:45.014
Why not?

36:46.686 --> 36:47.885
If we break up again,

36:49.766 --> 36:51.726
our past memories will be ruined too.

36:55.286 --> 36:56.445
Those are just past memories.

36:56.885 --> 36:58.246
It's not like you can relive them again.

36:58.445 --> 36:59.606
Are they that important?

37:01.606 --> 37:02.796
Yes.

37:04.045 --> 37:05.219
They're very important.
